title: 'Snowbridge: Reject DescendOrigin-prefixed XCM at AH Ethereum exporter'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    This PR achieves the following:
    - Add a `RejectDescendOriginExporter` `SendXcm` wrapper that rejects XCM messages whose first instruction is `DescendOrigin`, preventing `pallet_xcm::send` with signed origins from forwarding arbitrary XCM to Bridge Hub over XCMP.
    - Wrap the Ethereum `UnpaidRemoteExporter` in Asset Hub’s XCM router with this filter, so only executor-produced bridge messages (which do not start with `DescendOrigin`) are forwarded.
crates:
- name: snowbridge-outbound-queue-primitives
  bump: patch
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
- name: bridge-hub-westend-integration-tests
  bump: none

